SUMMARY:Wisconsin: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Due April 15\; without a federal extension\, Wisconsin automati
 cally grants a 7-month extension (or the original federal due date\, whiche
 ver is later). If a federal extension is filed\, the Wisconsin due date is 
 30 days after the federal extended due date. | Due April 15\; without a fed
 eral extension\, Wisconsin automatically grants a 7-month extension (or the
  original federal due date\, whichever is later). If a federal extension is
  filed\, the Wisconsin due date is 30 days after the federal extended due d
 ate. | Authority: Direct fetch of Wisconsin's own tax agency site/publicati
